  <metadata>
    <name>Hayden Rd, Benton County / part2 / simulator showcase</name>
    <desc>Follows the Arkansas GIS Office centerline of Hayden Rd (south to north), 1900 m: a run of three bends in 350 m, then two more. The real bundled curves on this road lie within 1 m of this line. Replay never uploads.</desc>
